@job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5250
@applicationId = 17
@sessionToken = REPLACE_WITH_A_LOCAL_TEST_TOKEN

### Create a disposable test account (choose your own test credentials)
POST {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
X-Auth-Mode: bearer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.test",
  "password": "ExamplePassword123"
}

### Log in, then copy accessToken into sessionToken locally. Never commit a real token.
POST {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
X-Auth-Mode: bearer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.test",
  "password": "ExamplePassword123"
}

### Inspect the current session
GET {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/session
X-Auth-Mode: bearer
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Revoke this session
POST {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}


### Hämta en jobbansökan
GET {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/JobApplications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Kontrollera valideringsfel (400)
POST {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/JobApplications
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "",
  "position": "Systemutvecklare",
  "location": "Linköping",
  "status": "Ogiltig status"
}

### Hämta alla jobbansökningar
GET {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/JobApplications
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Skapa en jobbansökan
POST {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/JobApplications
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Testföretag",
  "position": "Systemutvecklare",
  "location": "Linköping",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-17",
  "status": "Ansökt",
  "notes": "Test från .http-filen",
  "imageUrl": null
}

###

### Uppdatera en befintlig jobbansökan
PUT {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/JobApplications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Testföretag",
  "position": "Systemutvecklare .NET",
  "location": "Linköping",
  "dateApplied": "2026-09-17",
  "status": "Intervju",
  "notes": "Uppdaterad från .http-filen",
  "imageUrl": null
}

###

### Ta bort en befintlig jobbansökan
DELETE {{job_application_tracker_api_HostAddress}}/api/JobApplications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
